cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its outputs, please cite the paper (provisional entry below) and the PhysioNet database."
type: software
title: "ehg-sampen-state-associations: reproducible pipeline for sample-entropy gain sensitivity and state associations in electrohysterography (EHG9)"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived tables for a study of uterine-contraction (UC), fetal-movement (FM) and
  inactivity (IN) windows in the Icelandic 16-electrode EHG database: a 34-feature FWH-band
  mixed-model analysis, robustness and cross-channel checks, the gain sensitivity of finite-resolution
  sample-entropy profile summaries, and the gain-invariant (GI) alternative.
license: MIT
